{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Morning. Obs before you go in — blood pressure one forty-eight over ninety-two, heart rate seventy-eight, temp thirty-six point eight.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Ta. What is it?",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (PATIENT): Toe.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (DOCTOR): Sore?",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (PATIENT): Bad.",
  "[SEG0006] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Right big one. Since last night. Couldn't get his shoe on, hobbling round the house.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (DOCTOR): Swollen?",
  "[SEG0008] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0009] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): And red hot. I felt it myself.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): Fever?",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Other joints?",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (DOCTOR): Injury?",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (DOCTOR): So last night it just—",
  "[SEG0017] person_3 (PATIENT): Chair. Last night. Kicked it.",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (DOCTOR): Same before?",
  "[SEG0019] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (DOCTOR): When?",
  "[SEG0021] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): The parking was a nightmare, we nearly—",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (PATIENT): Year.",
  "[SEG0023] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): About a year back. Same toe, gone in a few days. Never got checked.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (DOCTOR): Tablets?",
  "[SEG0025] person_3 (PATIENT): Water.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (DOCTOR): Name and dose?",
  "[SEG0027] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Indapamide, two point five milligrams every morning. Blood pressure. Been years.",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (DOCTOR): Pressure still ongoing?",
  "[SEG0029] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (DOCTOR): Drink?",
  "[SEG0031] person_3 (PATIENT): Weekends.",
  "[SEG0032] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Beer. Few cans Saturday, sometimes Sunday arvo.",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any medicine allergies?",
  "[SEG0034] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (NURSE): Shocking hail in Footscray this morning. Traffic was dead stopped.",
  "[SEG0036] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): We sat forty minutes on the ring road. And the cricket's washed out, surely.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (DOCTOR): Pitch is covered, yeah.",
  "[SEG0038] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): How's that grandson of yours?",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (DOCTOR): Seven. Absolutely filthy. Lives for the Saturday.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Mine's the same with the footy. Meant to take him Sunday if it fined up.",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (DOCTOR): Shoe off. Right big toe joint's swollen and red, very tender to touch. Rest of the foot's fine.",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (DOCTOR): Looks like gout to me. Weekend beer, the water tablet, and the same a year back. That's the working idea, not a final diagnosis.",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (DOCTOR): I'll get a uric acid today, and start colchicine, half a milligram twice daily for five days.",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (DOCTOR): If the colchicine upsets your stomach, we switch to naproxen five hundred milligrams twice a day with food. Rather not, with the blood pressure, unless we have to.",
  "[SEG0045] person_2 (DOCTOR): Rest the foot, keep it elevated, ease off the beer while it's angry. See me in a week.",
  "[SEG0046] person_3 (PATIENT): Right."
 ],
